{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，Y把不少因果关系和情绪转折压进了小字或直接省略，尤其S05、S06、S08和S11，人物心理的细腻层次不如X；S07的“可以后”也有明显语病。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"X\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"作为扫屏观众，Y的大字能迅速建立每段的心理落点，而且“亲近”和“委屈”两个反复出现的核心词，把离开后的失落、反复犹豫到最后的自我选择串成了一条容易记住的线。X的优势是把动机、因果和情绪变化直接放在大字里，人物为什么这样想、为什么又改变想法，交代得更充分，心理质感也更细。总体我选Y，因为它更容易在听音乐时被连续接收，但它确实牺牲了一部分人物心理的可感知层次。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "f0109d14-05e2-4aff-8694-598ae4653eef", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261105T195354390762Z", "elapsed_seconds": 58.391, "completed_utc": "2026-11-05T19:54:52.787123+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "7b599d81db69464fae4f1e57d0a94dc8d5f871d8cf62e32e0c3e01acdf722b0a", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools